    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/4b630151aa5b746d02c5ff004304c23b.poster.avif?t=1755071321\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/4b630151aa5b746d02c5ff004304c23b.webm?t=1755071321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/4b630151aa5b746d02c5ff004304c23b.mp4?t=1755071321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/cf5b8079637a9586f734d0c318af07b2.avif?t=1755071321\" width=650 height=87 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In West City, 2135, half a century after mysterious superpowers emerged, society has undergone dramatic changes. &quot;Superpowered criminals&quot; - undetectable, unpredictable, and untraceable - have become a massive threat to social stability and prosperity. <br>In this chaotic era, the peace-loving superpowered girl &quot;Luna&quot; decides to follow her sister's path and join the government as a security officer to protect people. <br>At this critical moment, the terrorist organization &quot;Liberators&quot; hidden in a corner of the city begins large-scale operations\u2014 The rookie female officer Luna will soon understand that the &quot;Liberators&quot; are far more than just heinous superpowered criminals. Facing conflicting beliefs, people's lamentations, and historical truths... how will this society of superpowers navigate such despair ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/d452d183127d23d7e9e30b3a95ed56f4.avif?t=1755071321\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/0ba182d931c3a49b125bb471dde71f04.avif?t=1755071321\" width=650 height=87 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the &quot;Replication&quot; superpower, gradually uncover the truth of the superpowered society and embark on a path filled with mysteries and choices</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/241097a779637f7dc608d31e87bdc32b.poster.avif?t=1755071321\" width=800 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/241097a779637f7dc608d31e87bdc32b.webm?t=1755071321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/241097a779637f7dc608d31e87bdc32b.mp4?t=1755071321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/b5c5c12779593cf26b06c9d0f1633977.avif?t=1755071321\" width=650 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge unique female bosses with mysterious superpowers, where every decision will change the battle's direction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/f4b467f696f740b64a676106eca7dac5.avif?t=1755071321\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/3ce1b807385784f44a99b4f8c0a69965.avif?t=1755071321\" width=650 height=87 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your exclusive skill card deck at the base, upgrade and combine for powerful chain effects, and break through randomly generated challenges with imagination</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/b5ea97f69a011bf10ae998bb89c1552a.poster.avif?t=1755071321\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/b5ea97f69a011bf10ae998bb89c1552a.webm?t=1755071321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/b5ea97f69a011bf10ae998bb89c1552a.mp4?t=1755071321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/cbaf4d35a6e9ef08fa824a240fa9cb2f.avif?t=1755071321\" width=650 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/42d86aef64bb47f438935c279bc86e5c.avif?t=1755071321\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/12874c1bc61d3e1cfdcc0c806cf1140a.avif?t=1755071321\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437200/extras/2a1282803362ed0df973a582ab0d03fb.avif?t=1755071321\" dat